WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:13.865
All the things that I've done

00:00:20.035 --> 00:00:21.035
Memories

00:00:21.475 --> 00:00:23.045
They never hurt me.

00:00:26.215 --> 00:00:27.415
But the past

00:00:28.465 --> 00:00:30.005
is more than memories

00:00:31.915 --> 00:00:34.495
It's the devil you sold your soul to.

00:00:38.865 --> 00:00:40.085
He's coming.

00:00:49.405 --> 00:00:50.765
He's coming to collect.

